abstract: >-
  Synthetic manufacturing dataset (fictional plant Engxtech Manufacturing:
  production, maintenance, sensor, quality and monthly energy data), Power BI
  start and finished files for 9 sections, a formula cheat sheet and a capstone
  brief, accompanying the free video course Manufacturing Analytics for Engineers.
